","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m015-0234","start":234,"end":237,"surface":"取錢者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名使者、族屬或可能混作人名的乘車／館舍詞保持未定；馮軾不當馮驩，代舍不當蘇代，不補成員或親屬鏈。"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m015-0310","start":310,"end":313,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m015-0315","start":315,"end":318,"surface":"貸錢者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名使者、族屬或可能混作人名的乘車／館舍詞保持未定；馮軾不當馮驩，代舍不當蘇代，不補成員或親屬鏈。"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m015-0361","start":361,"end":363,"surface":"諸君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"收債宴席受話群體，不指孟嘗君個體。"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m015-0368","start":368,"end":369,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang","book_id":"b-shiji-075","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-075-mengchang"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:p016","text":"孟嘗君聞馮驩燒券書，怒而使使召驩。驩至，孟嘗君曰：「文食客三千人，故貸錢於薛。文奉邑少，而民尚多不以時與其息，客食恐不足，故請先生收責之。聞先生得錢，即以多具牛酒而燒券書，何？」馮驩曰：「然。不多具牛酒即不能畢會，無以知其有餘不足。有餘者，爲要期。不足者，雖守而責之十年，息愈多，急，即以逃亡自捐之。若急，終無以償，上則爲君好利不愛士民，下則有離上抵負之名，非所以厲士民彰君聲也。焚無用虚債之券，捐不可得之虚計，令薛民親君而彰君之善聲也，君有何疑焉！」孟嘗君乃拊手而謝之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"馮驩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"驩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"驩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"馮驩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0161","start":161,"end":162,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0210","start":210,"end":211,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0213","start":213,"end":214,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0219","start":219,"end":220,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m016-0226","start":226,"end":229,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang","book_id":"b-shiji-075","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-075-mengchang"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:p017","text":"齊王惑於秦、楚之毀，以爲孟嘗君名髙其主而擅齊國之權，遂廢孟嘗君。諸客見孟嘗君廢，皆去。馮驩曰：「借臣車一乘，可以入秦者，必令君重於國而奉邑益廣，可乎？」孟嘗君乃約車幣而遣之。馮驩乃西説秦王曰：「天下之游士馮軾結靷西入秦者，無不欲彊秦而弱齊；馮軾結靷東入齊者，無不欲彊齊而弱秦。此雄雌之國也，勢不兩立爲雄，雄者得天下矣。」秦王跽而問之曰：「何以使秦無爲雌而可？」馮驩曰：「王亦知齊之廢孟嘗君乎？」秦王曰：「聞之。」馮驩曰：「使齊重於天下者，孟嘗君也。今齊王以毀廢之，其心怨，必背齊；背齊入秦，則齊國之情，人事之誠，盡委之秦，齊地可得也，豈直爲雄也！君急使使載幣陰迎孟嘗君，不可失時也。如有齊覺悟，復用孟嘗君，則雌雄之所在未可知也。」秦王大悅，乃遣車十乘黃金百鎰以迎孟嘗君。馮驩辭以先行，至齊，説齊王曰：「天下之游士馮軾結靷東入齊者，無不欲彊齊而弱秦者；馮軾結靷西入秦者，無不欲彊秦而弱齊者。夫秦齊雄雌之國，秦彊則齊弱矣，此勢不兩雄。今臣竊聞秦遣使車十乘載黃金百鎰以迎孟嘗君。孟嘗君不西則已，西入相秦則天下歸之，秦爲雄而齊爲雌，雌則臨淄、即墨危矣。王何不先秦使之未到，復孟嘗君，而益與之邑以謝之？孟嘗君必喜而受之。秦雖彊國，豈可以請人相而迎之哉！折秦之謀，而絶其霸彊之略。」齊王曰：「善。」乃使人至境候秦使。秦使車適入齊境，使還馳告之，王召孟嘗君而復其相位，而與其故邑之地，又益以千戸。秦之使者聞孟嘗君復相齊，還車而去矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004371","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"諸客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名使者、族屬或可能混作人名的乘車／館舍詞保持未定；馮軾不當馮驩，代舍不當蘇代，不補成員或親屬鏈。"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"馮驩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004369","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004330","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m017-0087